# Binary working registers (the issue register is a living local doc, not tracked
# in git — its history lives in the session records). Markdown analysis/session
# docs ARE tracked (see the AHITS_*.md records already in the repo).
*.xlsx
# --- AHITS working cruft (not for version control) ---
_to_delete/
.ahits_write_test_*
.ahits-codebase-snapshot.tar.gz
# Scratch SQL/output from Claude Code sessions. The tracked record of a session is
# its AHITS_SESSION_HANDOFF_*.md; these are the loose working files beside it, and
# an untracked directory sitting in `git status` makes the SESSION CLOSE "git status
# clean" check meaningless. Added 2026-10-06 (PR-1b session).
Claude outputs/
